## 4. Acceptance — all must pass

```
python -m scraper.run --venue {{ venue.id }} --dry-run
python -m scraper.add --verify {{ venue.id }}        # fetches once, saves tests/fixtures/{{ venue.id }}/, runs the contract
pytest tests/test_contract.py -k {{ venue.id }}
pytest -q                                            # nothing else may break
```

The contract (`scraper/contract.py`) requires: at least one screening; ids identical across two parses;
non-empty titles; `start` with the offset of `{{ venue.timezone }}`; `day == start[:10]`; absolute URLs;
runtime 1–600; year 1888–next year; dates between the fetch day and `horizon_days + 60` days later.

## 5. Rules

- Do not work around CAPTCHAs, Cloudflare / Sucuri / Incapsula challenges or any WAF. If the site blocks
